cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Small Rust PDF Opener"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, lightweight PDF viewer and editor written in Rust using MuPDF
  and egui. Supports continuous scrolling, page edits (delete, rotate, reorder,
  crop), compression, visual signatures, PKCS#12 certificate signing, and
  optional offline OCR via downloadable ocrs models.
authors:
  - name: "will702"
    alias: "Willson"
